  max-height: 200px;
}

Request: For .rf-overflow-alpha: Allow automatic horizontal scrolling and hide vertical overflow. Return one rule with only the requested declarations.
Answer:
.rf-overflow-alpha {
  overflow-x: auto;
  overflow-y: hidden;
}

Request: For .rf-overflow-alpha: Hide overflow on both axes. Return one rule with only the requested declarations.
Answer:
